5. Algorithm for the project
Assume both input call logs are already sorted by date and time, from oldest to newest.

Create two linked lists, list1 and list2.

Insert the call records into their respective lists in chronological order.

Set pointers p and q to the heads of the two lists.

Create an empty merged list and a tail pointer.

Compare the timestamps of the calls pointed to by p and q.

Add the earlier call to the merged list and advance its pointer.

Repeat until one input list is empty.

Attach all remaining records from the other list.

Display the merged call log.

